		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Broad, verdant green leafy plant dotted with red blobs. 15 feet wide, consumes flesh.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 14, <strong>HP</strong> 43, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 slam +6 (1d10 + acid + adhesive), <strong>MV</strong> close, <strong>S</strong> +5, <strong>D</strong> +4, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> -3, <strong>W</strong> +0, <strong>Ch</strong> -3, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 9</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Acid</strong>. Organic objects that touch the sundew dissolve on a d6 roll of 1-3.</p><p></p><p><strong>Adhesive</strong>. STR 15+ or adhere to sundew; auto-hit with slam. STR 15+ on turn to remove.</p><p></p><p><strong>Pollen</strong>. 1/day, when at or below 20 HP, release pollen cloud in near-sized cube centered on sundew. CON 15+ or dazed for 1d4 rounds.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
